      "description": "Built jar on port 5621. UpdateRecipes: the Climbing Log takes any Wood_Trunk, and all 40 houses sit at Ranching Bench tiers 1 to 3 as in the fix7 table. Poop: three droppings merge into one pile; /ranch produce poop pick runs the engine path the use key runs (BreakBlock Harvest: performPickupByInteraction) and puts all 3 Ingredient_Poop in the inventory with the gather hint, removing the pile; breaking a new pile still drops its poop.",
